      "section": "storm-collection",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside Qi Jue grotto-heaven, a deep blue qi current strikes Clear Jade Dripping Wind Tiny Bamboo Building hard enough that a Southern Border Gu Immortal names it lightning qi and judges its quality on par with rank eight immortal materials. The current costs the Immortal Gu House some Gu worms before Wu Yong replenishes them. In calmer circumstances the Southern Border Gu Immortals would want to collect that lightning qi.",
